<view class="page">
  <view class="section">学年</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="line">
      <text>当前学年</text>
      <text class="value">{{year}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>下一学年</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{nextYear}}" bindinput="onNextYear" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onArchive">切换学年</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新主席</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="dept-tabs">
      <view
        class="dept-tab {{index === chairmanDept ? 'dept-tab--on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{deptLabels}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindtap="onChairmanDept"
      >{{item}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>选择部长</text>
      <text class="value">已选 {{chairmanCount}} 人</text>
    </view>
    <view class="chips" wx:if="{{chairmanCandidates.length}}">
      <view
        class="chip {{item.checked ? 'chip--on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{chairmanCandidates}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="onToggleChairman"
      >{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
    <text class="muted" wx:else>该部门暂无可任命的部长</text>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointChairmen">任命为主席</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">任命新部长</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="dept-tabs">
      <view
        class="dept-tab {{index === ministerDept ? 'dept-tab--on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{deptLabels}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindtap="onMinisterDept"
      >{{item}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="line">
      <text>选择小干</text>
      <text class="value">已选 {{ministerCount}} 人</text>
    </view>
    <view class="chips" wx:if="{{ministerCandidates.length}}">
      <view
        class="chip {{item.checked ? 'chip--on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{ministerCandidates}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="onToggleMinister"
      >{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
    <text class="muted" wx:else>该部门暂无可任命的小干</text>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost btn-top" bindtap="onAppointMinisters">任命为部长</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    先选部门，再选该部门成员：主席从部长中任命，部长从小干中任命，均支持多选；任命后会向对方发送站内消息。
  </view>
</view>
